    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist Epic Auto Towers, a game from our son, a professional game developer!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p>We have edited some levels to make the game more harmonious.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bomb Bowling 2 is an indie puzzle game with physics.<br></li><li>Knock the pins off the screen using explosions. <br></li><li>Keep track of what is happening and then select the moment for the accurate click.<br></li><li>The sequel of the Bomb Bowling.<br></li><li>50 levels with new contents.<br></li><li>Hone your skills before a new challenges!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161680/extras/942665cef3a02186516b73d141a48e04.poster.avif?t=1695479338\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161680/extras/942665cef3a02186516b73d141a48e04.webm?t=1695479338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161680/extras/942665cef3a02186516b73d141a48e04.mp4?t=1695479338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
